<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    {{ icon("document-verification", 56) }}
    <p class="tag">Specialised Service</p>
    <h1>Need to Verify a Visa or Immigration Document?</h1>
    <p class="service-lede">Confirm the authenticity or status of a Philippine visa or immigration document.</p>

    <p>If you are uncertain about the authenticity, validity or status of a Philippine visa or immigration document, Foreign Immigration Services can assist in identifying the appropriate verification process and, where available, facilitate verification with the relevant authority.</p>

    <h2>How We Can Assist</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Reviewing the document and information you provide</li>
      <li>Identifying the appropriate verification process for that document type</li>
      <li>Facilitating verification with the relevant authority, where available</li>
      <li>Explaining the outcome and any next steps</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Common Situations We Handle</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Confirming a visa or immigration document before relying on it</li>
      <li>Verifying a document presented by a third party</li>
      <li>Checking the status of a document connected to your own immigration record</li>
      <li>Other document verification circumstances</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="context-note">
      <p>Not every document type can be verified through every channel. The available verification process, if any, depends on the specific document and the authority that issued it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="service-cta">
      <h2>Verify a Document</h2>
      <p>Share the details of the document in question and we will identify the appropriate next step.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/?service=document-verification">Request Document Verification</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
